Package: sparkapp-plugin-news
Architecture: any
Depends: sparkapp-core, spark-plugin-abi-1, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Spark ORG news management plugin
 Optional plugin for the Spark ORG clients. Adds news editing, deletion
 and home-page pick management actions. Requests are proxied by the
 client, so the plugin never receives account tokens.

Package: sparkapp-plugin-forum
Architecture: any
Depends: sparkapp-core, spark-plugin-abi-1, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Spark ORG forum management plugin
 Optional plugin for the Spark ORG clients. Adds discussion creation,
 replies, moderation (sticky, locked, hidden) and deletion. The plugin
 uses the forum account through the client and never receives tokens.
